Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.55,0:01:21.47,Title Part 4 Episode 2,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(549,646)\pos(132,873)\fs60}Episode 3: {\fs80} The Nijimura Brothers Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've taken care of Angelo for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it'll be a while till I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that other photo\Nwe've been looking into.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would, please send it over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, from Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one the Speedwagon\NFoundation found ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might have figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ironically, it's all thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I murdered your grandpa, but that\Ndoesn't mean you can put me to death too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you kill me, you'll end up\Ncursed just like yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So back off if you know\Nwhat's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rude to point your finger at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't your mother ever teach you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take solace in the\Nfact no one's gonna execute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me, and not this guy either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor will we be turning\Nyou into the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you psychotic\Nbastards planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your eternal penance, Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reflect on the life you stole from\Nmy grandpa and all the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you bastards all to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get cocky, you little shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you've won,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he'll be here to butcher you\Ninto bloody pieces soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:03:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What who is he oh you'll find out he\Nwears a school uniform and he's the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gave me this power\Nhang on you're saying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that there's someone out\Nthere who can bestow the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power of a stand scared\Nyeah nice try pal but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's so scary about\Nthat wait he's telling the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,truth about not being\Nborn a stand user thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is no one knew how he\Nobtained his powers just
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think about it what if\Nthere really is a person
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who can impart stands to\Nothers petrifying thought
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't it do you want to\Nknow more it happened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,last year 1998 about a\Nmonth before my execution
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was to be carried out i\Nremember that night well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was cloudy and i\Ncouldn't sleep with a damn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i just sat there staring\Noff into the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was quiet dead quiet\Nthen all of a sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it happened in that shitty\Nexcuse for a solitary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cell there he was the guy\Nin the school uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who let you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was holding an ancient bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of him, they must\Nhave been hundreds of years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was scared shitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like my balls\Ncrawled into my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I could let out a scream...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, you survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what's more, you have talent,\Notherwise you'd be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of this moment, you've\Nacquired a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps I should simply say\Nthat I extracted it from your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more wicked the criminal,\Nthe more talent he holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a talent that a man named\NDio once referred to as a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, that's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so captivated by my story, you\Ncompletely forgot about my aqua necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you've lost, so get\Nme the hell out of this rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have considered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this pathetic show of yours\Nwas actually making me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to get me\Nout of this stupid rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doc, if you don't get a move on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and your prissy-ass hair\Nare getting ripped apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Chosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you call my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guy in the school uniform is just\Ngonna hunt you down to do the same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say earlier, but\Nhe lives in this town too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke, stand down!
