Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give him this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He managed to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I thought it was only fair to repay the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dickwad by turning him\Ninto a great work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We needed to keep him\Ntalking a little longer. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me you\Nbelieved any of that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or didn't you hear him when\Nhe was going on about Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard him. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar's greatest enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our family was fighting him\Nfor over a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all came to a head ten years\Nago, when we defeated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's one thing none\Nof us could ever figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio didn't have a stand in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how the hell did he suddenly\Ngain such a powerful one in 1987?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he got it from the same guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we may have found a new\Nenemy in this school uniform guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or it could be that the bow and\Narrow is the source of this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was right, and it's\Nhiding somewhere in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then Angelo was just the opening act\Nin a horror show of epic proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something evil\Nlurking in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catastrophic dangers\Nclosing in as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number of missing persons reported in\NMorioh has risen to 81 in this year alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,45 of which were children,\Neven if some were runaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's still seven to eight times\Nmore than the national average.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's outrageous.
