Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.57,0:08:37.07,Episode 3 Typesetting 2a,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz312.5\be0.08\pos(927.771,474.2)}Higashikata Ryohei: Dead \N(Morioh Police Officer)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke's grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,School's out, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you still studying there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke seems to be feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, has this rock always been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's been given a facelift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Facelift?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know? Yo, Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask,\Nwhat happened to Mr. Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said there was some stuff\Nhe needed to look into,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he went back over to the Grand Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it has to do with the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're facing a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's a... Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be wrong, but hasn't this\Nhouse been abandoned for a few years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I doubt anyone\Nwould buy this eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd be better off bulldozing\Nit and starting over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe they just moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I looked up at the window,\NI could have sworn I saw someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget where I live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have noticed if someone moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always see real estate guys patrolling\Nthe area looking for squatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but maybe I saw a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaky. Come on, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off with crap like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ghosts give me the willies, not\Nto mention I live right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try keeping your nose out of other\Npeople's business, little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi no! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be the one\Nasking you that question!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your friends are on my property!
