Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's about the newspaper,\NI said we don't want any!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, buddy, I just\Nlost my dad to a stroke,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm still trying to figure out what\Nthe hell my family's going to do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally came back for\Nme after all of these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since dad died, it's been like living\Nin an endless sea of depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came when I needed\Nyou most, Joseph, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to disappoint you, but I'm\Nnot the Joe star you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, not a wrinkle on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now that you mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do look younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Joseph's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, his grandson, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke will tell you\Nthe rest of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tedious chit-chat drives me up the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Josuke, is he around?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked where Josuke is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, the school day just\Nended, so he isn't home yet. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be back tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait you're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about your father—his\Ndeath was a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:13:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Joseph Joestar were here,\Nhe'd protect you with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'd leap into danger\Nof him and keeping you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's an old man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be irresponsible\Nto let him come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here in his stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bow and arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo mentioned the intel on Anyaba that\Nthe Speed Wagon Foundation found in Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the fact that the witch\Nis holding a bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really imparts the power of\Nthe Stand to ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completely\Nlost your freaking mind?
