Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me make something real clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pop bought this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm not gonna\Nlet you snoop around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're the one\Nwho's not getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to let\Ngo of my friend, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to tick me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not nice to call people names.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when the person\Nyou're insulting just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens to own the property\Nyou're trespassing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, don't you know how to be polite?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that I'm gonna smash your face\Nin if you don't shut your goddamn mouth.
