Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interested as to why I\Nshot him with the arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that goon is\NJosuke Higashikata. Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.39,Episode 3 Typesetting 3b,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz354.4\pos(1434.857,832.857)}No Trespassing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that he defeated Angelo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his stand abilities will likely\Npose a nuisance to us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know about stands too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out with it, are you stand users?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, make Josuke\NHigashikata disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had hopes he'd turn into a stand\Nuser, and a useful one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But alas, it was all for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still time for me to heal his\Ninjury using Shining Diamond's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Okuyasu Nijimura will make\Nyou vanish, so behold the hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, or I'll make good\Non my promise to smash your face in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta admit, you're pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:16:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears manipulating a stand is a\Nlot like driving a car or motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any bumbling half-wit can get in the\Ndriver's seat of a muscle machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but with only air between his ears,\Nhe'll still be too scared to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey bro, why the heck did you have to\Ngo and say all of that mean stuff for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bastard's just a little faster\Nthan I thought he was gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you this\Nisn't a game, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a time when the\Nmere thought of your stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hand, sent horrific chills\Nstreaking down my spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to kill Angelo's\Nmurderer, Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't end him now, he'll prove\Ntroublesome in the future. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was talking to my bro back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, you're not too\Nbright, are you? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bright? Why do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God you're still with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can save you before it's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna tell you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna piss me off, keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.02,0:17:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you've got the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, he's got way too much\Nconfidence in his right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me... Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of my right hand,\Nyou son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is his right hand!
