Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want to\Nleave your friend behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is definitely\Nup with your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gut is telling me that there's\Nmore to it than you're letting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can think about my\Nhands once you're warm food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, hang on a little longer.
