Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I wouldn't be so\Nquick to back up, you flimsy prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or don't you care about\Nmoving away from your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come a little closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sign's missing half a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hand didn't make part\Nof that sign disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cuts out space in midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your stand's ability, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo, Josuke Higashikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand's right hand can make\Nwhatever it grabs disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the void that's left behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closes and pulls together the space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as if it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for the part my hand takes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once my unlucky target\Nis sucked into the void?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a freaking\Nclue where it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you try to run, it wouldn't\Nmatter cause I can still do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to grab some space and then
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you came right to me it's\Nlike teleporting isn't it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't get the\Nmemo you're up against the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand a Stand that even my\Nbro fears Try as you might,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where you try to hide,\Nyou're always within my reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go ahead, punk, make my day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wakeling, how is a piece of dog shit\Nlike you able to take down Angelo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.60,0:20:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you haven't figured\Nout how worthless you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which one of us wasn't bright again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and die,\NJosuke! That proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, sir, are truly an idiot. Say what?
