Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.14,0:20:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu Nijimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say his stand was pretty\Ngreat, but I'm not one to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be a pain in the ass when\Nhe wakes up and tries to attack me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.60,0:20:59.44,Episode 3 Typesetting 3g,Sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\fs30\pos(1267.728,384.28)\frz0.2587}No   passing
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.60,0:20:59.44,Episode 3 Typesetting 3g,Sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\fs38\fax0.03\pos(343.287,345.787)\frz358.9\frx0\fry345.6}No Trespassing
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.60,0:20:59.44,Episode 3 Typesetting 3g,Sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\fs38\pos(352.014,341.423)\frz358.6}No Trespassing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I better draw out his nap\Nwith some gentle asphyxiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll definitely put the\Nsting of defeat in his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This arrow is irreplaceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's essential to my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And losing it is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo's story says it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt this is the bow and\Narrow that unleashed Dio's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weapon that released the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Inyaba's death, someone must\Nhave nabbed the bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now they're using it\Nto create more stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find and\Ndestroy the damn thing, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.82,0:22:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A villain fouler than Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or worse, a stand user who wields\Neven more power than the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let either come to pass.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.84,0:22:52.22,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.22,0:22:54.47,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.47,0:22:57.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.27,0:22:58.94,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.94,0:23:01.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.31,0:23:03.69,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.97,0:23:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.69,0:23:06.48,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.82,0:23:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the humic and the ball\Nthat I need to, I want to!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.48,0:23:08.19,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.19,0:23:10.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.45,0:23:12.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.54,0:23:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.78,0:23:14.41,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.41,0:23:17.04,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.04,0:23:21.54,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ooh, I find you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.54,0:23:25.09,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.09,0:23:30.55,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who am I trying to find out?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.55,0:23:33.93,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
